    "codeLanguage": "javascript",
    "title": "Zatrzymywanie pętli while",
    "descriptionContent": "Dowiedz się, jak używać zmiennej do zatrzymywania pętli while",
    "shortDescriptionContent": "",
    "showInTrack": true,
    "iconBanner": null,
    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17314,
        "title": "Przerywanie pętli while",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 146687,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Do tej pory nauczyliśmy się, jak tworzyć pętlę while. Teraz skupmy się na tym, jak zatrzymać jej nieskończone wykonywanie.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;game loop tick&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 146688,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aby zatrzymać pętlę, zaczynamy od utworzenia zmiennej poza pętlą.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"22\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;game loop tick&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>let</code>, następnie <code>gameRunning</code>, a potem <code>=</code>, <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 146689,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Używamy zmiennej w warunku, aby zdecydować, czy pętla powinna wykonać swój blok kodu. Na przykład: <code>(gameRunning === true)</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"46\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameRunning === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;game loop tick&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>gameRunning</code>, a następnie <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 146690,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>W bloku kodu zatrzymujemy pętlę, ustawiając <code>gameRunning</code> na <code>false</code>, aby warunek zwrócił <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"107\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameRunning === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;game loop tick&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 146691,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pętla wykonuje cały blok kodu, ponieważ na początku <code>gameRunning</code> ma wartość <code>true</code>, ale nie wykonuje go ponownie, jeśli ustawimy <code>gameRunning</code> na <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"120\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameRunning === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;gameRunning: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + gameRunning);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;gameRunning: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + gameRunning);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 146692,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Skąd wiemy, że ta pętla działa i nigdy nie przestaje powtarzać swojego bloku kodu?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelLoaded = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawning enemies&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">W warunku nie ma zmiennej</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ta pętla się nie wykona, ponieważ warunek to <code>false</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">W warunku nie ma zmiennej.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 146693,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Skąd wiemy, że pętla <code>while</code> pomija swój blok kodu?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPaused = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isPaused === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Paused...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Wartość <code>isPaused</code> to <code>false</code>, ale warunek sprawdza, czy wynosi <code>true</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Wartość <code>isPaused</code> to <code>false</code>, a warunek sprawdza, czy wynosi <code>false</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wartość <code>isPaused</code> to <code>false</code>, ale warunek sprawdza, czy wynosi <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 146694,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Skąd wiemy, że ta pętla się zatrzymuje?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameRunning === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Update player and enemies&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Zmienna <code>gameRunning</code> jest aktualizowana do wartości <code>false</code> wewnątrz bloku kodu</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nie wiemy, czy pętla się zatrzymuje</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Zmienna <code>gameRunning</code> jest aktualizowana do wartości <code>false</code> wewnątrz bloku kodu.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 146695,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetla ten kod w konsoli?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameRunning === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level start!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Poziom rozpoczęty!</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ten kod niczego nie wyświetla w konsoli</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Poziom rozpoczęty!</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 146696,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aby użyć zmiennej w warunku pętli while, utwórz ją poza blokiem kodu.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameRunning === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Starting level...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>let</code>, następnie <code>gameRunning</code>, a potem <code>=</code>, <code>true</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 146697,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pomiń pętlę, używając zmiennej <code>isPaused</code> w warunku.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"37\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPaused = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isPaused === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Paused...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" isPaused = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>isPaused</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 146698,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wewnątrz bloku kodu zatrzymaj pętlę po wykonaniu jej bloku kodu, aktualizując <code>gameRunning</code> na <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"105\" /><option startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"111\" endIndex=\"112\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameRunning === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy wave spawned&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>gameRunning</code>, następnie <code>=</code>, a potem <code>false</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 146699,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wewnątrz bloku kodu zatrzymaj pętlę po wykonaniu jej bloku kodu, ustawiając <code>gameRunning</code> na <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"111\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameRunning === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy wave spawned&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}